VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'observe them all uh down to the core. All right, they need to be inspectable by human and by an agent. So, the patterns, as you see, they as these things emerge, they must be mixed'

[11:21] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and combined together. So, what does this all have in common? I think that execution is fundamental to building any of these systems. So, let\'s just take one example here,'

