AUDIO: 'background agents, right? They\'re not request response. There\'s no person just waiting there for you for the the the chatbot to respond. So, it could might run for minutes or hours. It\'s going to have maybe hundreds of'

[11:46] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'calls to you know, maybe 200 tool calls. You\'re going to probably guarantee to have at least one failure in that. So, you can\'t even debug your background agent that\'s running asynchronously'

[11:59] [scene:talk]
